    <text>
        <front>
            <div type="summary">
                <p>
                    Flora Mayor wirtes to Leonard Wolf proposing to place an add in The Cambridge review since it was mentioned in her novel <title>The Rector's Daughter</title>. She then goes on to remark that Oxford is better and that Cambridge has been rather ungrateful.
                </p>
            </div>
        </front>
        <body>
            <div type="letter">
                <opener>
                    <dateline>
                        <date when="1924-09-17">
                            Sept. 17
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                    <salute>
                        Dear Mr. Woolf
                    </salute>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    I have been won- <lb/>
                    dering whether anything <lb/>
                    could be done to take <orgName key="Q35794">Cam- <lb/>
                    bridge</orgName>. What about an ad- <lb/>
                    vertisement in <orgName key="Q51405544">The Cambridge <lb/>
                    Review</orgName>? <orgName>Cambridge</orgName> is <lb/>
                    mentioned so honourably <lb/>
                    in <title>The Rector's Daughter</title> <lb/>
                    that I think, it ought to <lb/>
                    show its appreciation. I <lb/>
                    do not think <orgName>Cambridge</orgName> <lb/>
                    has hinted at how superior it <lb/> <pb/>
                    is to <orgName key="Q34433">Oxford</orgName>. Personally I think <lb/>
                    <orgName>Cambridge</orgName> has been <lb/>
                    rather ungrateful about it. <lb/>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <salute>
                        Yours sincerely
                    </salute>
                    <signed> 
                        <choice>
                            <abbr>
                                <persName key="Q5423968">Fl. Mayor</persName>
                            </abbr> 
                        </choice>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
